<title>CHINA: Shanghai rice futures fail to trade for third day.</title>
<headline>Shanghai rice futures fail to trade for third day.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai rice futures did not trade for the third sessions in a row on Friday with investors losing interest in rice contracts, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Almost all the investors have moved their money into other active markets, including the A share stock market,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Traders said few investors would have interest in rice in the next few days due to a lack of market-moving news.</p>
<p>($1=8.2980 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Shanghai newsroom (86-21) 6279-7004</p>
</text>
